{"2749950":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Esports Manager 2026","steam_appid":2749950,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>PLAY THE DEMO<\/h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/ba33cdc5957418b10a94894811a51355.poster.avif?t=1793116952\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/ba33cdc5957418b10a94894811a51355.webm?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/ba33cdc5957418b10a94894811a51355.mp4?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/495a9fc13de33d68ed9ebe89cf0be4b3.avif?t=1793116952\" width=780 height=100 \/><\/span>Welcome to <i>Esports Manager 2026<\/i>, a strategy-simulation game where you take charge of a competitive esports organization from the inside out<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from scratch or take over one of the existing teams. Navigate the complexities of player recruitment, team development, tournament schedules, and business operations. Whether you're optimizing training, making key transfer decisions, or managing the mental health and motivation of your roster, every move counts toward your legacy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no scripted campaign or forced ending—your journey continues as long as your manager stays active. Grow, adapt, and lead your team to the top.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/11a3b31a0678ef1187b6f609db906d84.avif?t=1793116952\" width=780 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simulation Mode<\/strong><br>Step into the match yourself with the Simulation module—an immersive, highly detailed experience where you control tactics and react to dynamic in-game events in real time.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/7461f43cce86857bc12055f9bc60e462.poster.avif?t=1793116952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/7461f43cce86857bc12055f9bc60e462.webm?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/7461f43cce86857bc12055f9bc60e462.mp4?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realism and Depth<\/strong> <br>Inspired by the real-world challenges of esports management—balancing financial, psychological, legal, and organizational responsibilities with no hand-holding.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Organizations, Real Players<\/strong><br>Choose from a wide range of authentic teams and manage a roster filled with real professional players. Build your lineup your way.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/44345a1b9f03230b7d187020b1ce6ea3.poster.avif?t=1793116952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/44345a1b9f03230b7d187020b1ce6ea3.webm?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/44345a1b9f03230b7d187020b1ce6ea3.mp4?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Market and Transfers<\/strong><br>Buy, sell, and loan players to create the best roster for your goals. Market dynamics, contract negotiations, and timing all matter.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Development and Morale<\/strong><br>Design weekly training plans that target both skill growth and well-being. Use team-building, psychology sessions, and smart scheduling to shape high-performance athletes.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/4b2383aafc9083b54e78a65ba60ba8c5.poster.avif?t=1793116952\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/4b2383aafc9083b54e78a65ba60ba8c5.webm?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2749950\/extras\/4b2383aafc9083b54e78a65ba60ba8c5.mp4?t=1793116952\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leadership and Player Interaction<\/strong> <br>Get to know your players. Understand their needs and motivations, and guide them through ups and downs both on and off the stage. Use the in-depth Talk module to communicate with players and staff, understand their needs, and leverage the result of the conversation into something truly unique and useful.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournaments and Rankings<\/strong><br>Enter your organization into 